      "v": "758764_3",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Then Laura and I would laugh and laugh and...you know what, nevermind.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "758765_2",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "So, if Laura Dern and I were in the same vinyasa yoga class, I MEAN COULD YOU EVEN IMAGINE, and we both arched our backs into cat pose, but then dropped our bellies and lifted our heads into BITILASANA, what’s a cool thing I could say to Laura Dern?",
